msgstr "**Exchange properties:** the issue's workspace and a reference to the project (``link-project:project``) — these are needed by the other Jira components."

#: ../../../../../../../Users/antivanov/Documents/workspace-ctk/ecos-docs/docs/integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:115
